<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Artery blockage -->
  <UG_ArteryBlockage.label>动脉阻塞</UG_ArteryBlockage.label>
  <UG_ArteryBlockage.labelShortAdj>动脉阻塞</UG_ArteryBlockage.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene tend to deposit lipid plaques on the inner walls of their blood vessels. The arteries of the heart gradually clog, impairing blood supply throughout the body. -->
  <UG_ArteryBlockage.description>这种基因的携带者血管内壁更容易沉积脂质斑块，心脏的动脉会逐渐堵塞，进而影响全身的血液供应。</UG_ArteryBlockage.description>
  <UG_ArteryBlockage.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>获得动脉阻塞</li>
  </UG_ArteryBlockage.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Cataract -->
  <UG_Cataract.label>白内障</UG_Cataract.label>
  <UG_Cataract.labelShortAdj>白内障</UG_Cataract.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene develop clouded lenses, leading to impaired vision. -->
  <UG_Cataract.description>这种基因的携带者晶状体浑浊导致视力障碍。</UG_Cataract.description>
  <UG_Cataract.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>获得白内障</li>
  </UG_Cataract.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Easily tempted -->
  <UG_EasilyTempted.label>易受诱惑</UG_EasilyTempted.label>
  <UG_EasilyTempted.labelShortAdj>易受诱惑</UG_EasilyTempted.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene are easily tempted by substances. -->
  <UG_EasilyTempted.description>这种基因的携带者容易受到物质诱惑。</UG_EasilyTempted.description>

  <!-- EN: Epilepsy -->
  <UG_Epilepsy.label>癫痫</UG_Epilepsy.label>
  <UG_Epilepsy.labelShortAdj>癫痫</UG_Epilepsy.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a markedly higher chance of abnormal electrical discharges in the brain. Seizures cause sudden loss of consciousness. -->
  <UG_Epilepsy.description>这种基因的携带者大脑异常放电的概率明显偏高。发作时会突然失去意识。</UG_Epilepsy.description>
  <UG_Epilepsy.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>每天2%的概率癫痫发作</li>
  </UG_Epilepsy.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Forgetful -->
  <UG_Forgetful.label>健忘</UG_Forgetful.label>
  <UG_Forgetful.labelShortAdj>健忘</UG_Forgetful.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene lose their memories quickly. What they learn rarely sticks. -->
  <UG_Forgetful.description>这种基因的携带者记忆力衰退得很快，学过的东西总是留不住。</UG_Forgetful.description>
  <UG_Forgetful.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>所有等级的技能都会持续遗忘</li>
    <li>技能遗忘速度x150%</li>
  </UG_Forgetful.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Fragile spine -->
  <UG_FragileSpine.label>脆弱脊柱</UG_FragileSpine.label>
  <UG_FragileSpine.labelShortAdj>脆脊</UG_FragileSpine.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have poorly developed, brittle vertebrae that can barely withstand any impact. -->
  <UG_FragileSpine.description>这种基因的携带者脊椎发育不良、骨质松脆，几乎无法承受任何冲击。</UG_FragileSpine.description>

  <!-- EN: Hearing loss -->
  <UG_HearingLoss.label>耳聋</UG_HearingLoss.label>
  <UG_HearingLoss.labelShortAdj>耳聋</UG_HearingLoss.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene suffer from cochlear degeneration that distorts the transmission of sound information. -->
  <UG_HearingLoss.description>这种基因的携带者耳蜗质性病变导致声音信息的异常传递。</UG_HearingLoss.description>
  <UG_HearingLoss.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>双耳部件效率-50%</li>
  </UG_HearingLoss.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Hypertrophic scarring -->
  <UG_HypertrophicScar.label>增生性疤痕</UG_HypertrophicScar.label>
  <UG_HypertrophicScar.labelShortAdj>疤痕体质</UG_HypertrophicScar.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene heal with excessive tissue growth, leaving permanent scars. -->
  <UG_HypertrophicScar.description>这种基因的携带者伤口愈合时更容易过度增生，留下永久的疤痕。</UG_HypertrophicScar.description>
  <UG_HypertrophicScar.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>受伤后留下永久疤痕的概率提高</li>
  </UG_HypertrophicScar.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Kidney failure -->
  <UG_KidneyFailure.label>肾衰竭</UG_KidneyFailure.label>
  <UG_KidneyFailure.labelShortAdj>肾衰</UG_KidneyFailure.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene suffer progressive kidney degeneration, as if from organ decay. Blood filtration steadily declines until the organs fail entirely. -->
  <UG_KidneyFailure.description>这种基因的携带者的肾脏会像患了器官衰竭一样不断退化，血液过滤能力持续下降，最终器官彻底坏死。</UG_KidneyFailure.description>
  <UG_KidneyFailure.customEffectDescriptions>
    <li>获得器官衰竭(肾)</li>
  </UG_KidneyFailure.customEffectDescriptions>

  <!-- EN: Neurasthenia -->
  <UG_Neurasthenia.label>神经衰弱</UG_Neurasthenia.label>
  <UG_Neurasthenia.labelShortAdj>神经衰弱</UG_Neurasthenia.labelShortAdj>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene alternate between nervous overstimulation and exhaustion, and sleep poorly. -->
  <UG_Neurasthenia.description>这种基因的携带者神经系统长期处于过度兴奋与疲劳交替的状态，睡眠质量极差。</UG_Neurasthenia.description>

</LanguageData>